<title>BRAZIL: Brazil to reveal voluntary redundancy plan.</title>
<headline>Brazil to reveal voluntary redundancy plan.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil will announce on Tuesday a voluntary redundancy programme for federal government workers, a spokeswoman for the Administration Ministry said.</p>
<p>She said Administration Minister Luis Carlos Bresser Pereira would give a news conference at 1600 local time/1800 GMT.</p>
<p>The redundancy plan may affect up to 30,000 of the federal government's 560,000 workers, newspapers have reported.</p>
<p>-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 55-61-2230358</p>
